<decision #fix-deepseek-thinking-tool-roundtrip.wire-display-separation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JQ1R112Q2BRXDS6680VET>
  DeepSeek reasoning 的协议保真和 TUI 重复展示应如何协调？
  </?01M18JQ1R112Q2BRXDS6680VET>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AVZ>
    用户要求先使用 codument-plan-track，再使用 codument-impl-track 修复已确认的 DeepSeek interleaved thinking 工具调用问题。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AVZ>
    <decision-text ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW0>
    始终保留 provider wire-level reasoning_content；TUI 是否显示镜像 thinking 使用独立策略，禁止通过删除协议字段实现展示去重。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW0>
    <rationale ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW1>
    DeepSeek tools 协议要求后续请求完整回传 reasoning_content，而展示去重只是本地 presentation concern。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW1>
    <evidence ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW2>
    故障 session turn 139 缺 reasoning_content 后，turn 140 返回明确的 HTTP 400；stream adapter 当前会删除空值和镜像值。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW2>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW3>
  0.95
  </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW3>
  <reversibility ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW4>
  moderate
  </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW4>
)>

<decision #fix-deepseek-thinking-tool-roundtrip.legacy-recovery apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW5>
  升级前已经缺失 reasoning_content 的历史 session 如何恢复？
  </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW5>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW6>
    按无需修改历史 session 文件且可以继续现有会话的目标处理。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW6>
    <decision-text ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW7>
    DeepSeek 请求归一化对缺字段的 assistant tool-call 历史消息补 reasoning_content 空字符串；不修改 XNL 持久化文件。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW7>
    <rationale ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW8>
    原始 SSE 未持久化，真实 reasoning 无法重建；请求边界 fallback 是最小且可逆的兼容方案。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW8>
    <evidence ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW9>
    故障 history 和 effect evidence 均已缺字段，provider 错误要求字段必须传回。
    </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AW9>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AWA>
  0.95
  </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AWA>
  <reversibility ?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AWB>
  moderate
  </?01M18JQ1R2ZE7C5871SE7H1AWB>
)>
